":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/fec66319-405a-4e8d-8457-4bdc68e752d3.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to Get Started","synopsis":"What is meditation? Begin your journey toward a calmer, clearer mind by learning the basics and try a guided meditation that focuses on the breath.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/fec66319-405a-4e8d-8457-4bdc68e752d3.webp"}}}},{"number":2,"title":"How to Let Go","synopsis":"Drop that baggage — and let go of anger, frustration and longing. This effortless guided meditation takes an easygoing approach to visualization.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/5b6e0ae7-b79c-41cf-b474-4c5a03bc5f68.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to Let Go","synopsis":"Drop that baggage — and let go of anger, frustration and longing. This effortless guided meditation takes an easygoing approach to visualization.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/5b6e0ae7-b79c-41cf-b474-4c5a03bc5f68.webp"}}}},{"number":3,"title":"How to Fall in Love with Life","synopsis":"Pause for a moment of gratitude, and learn to listen to the mind. Andy explores ways to fall in love with life and introduces a reflection meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/25eeac5e-bcab-4166-84f3-4a4f9f51d451.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to Fall in Love with Life","synopsis":"Pause for a moment of gratitude, and learn to listen to the mind. Andy explores ways to fall in love with life and introduces a reflection meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/25eeac5e-bcab-4166-84f3-4a4f9f51d451.webp"}}}},{"number":4,"title":"How to Deal with Stress","synopsis":"Overwhelmed? It often begins within. Change this relationship to anxiety and cope with stress using a simple, powerful meditation technique: noting.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/38c360a9-cdb3-4df5-b762-e5865c5316e7.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to Deal with Stress","synopsis":"Overwhelmed? It often begins within. Change this relationship to anxiety and cope with stress using a simple, powerful meditation technique: noting.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/38c360a9-cdb3-4df5-b762-e5865c5316e7.webp"}}}},{"number":5,"title":"How to be Kind","synopsis":"Release resentment toward others — and oneself — and learn to live with greater compassion. Andy guides a loving kindness meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/699abf77-8d61-4036-8432-dca39d2cecdf.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to be Kind","synopsis":"Release resentment toward others — and oneself — and learn to live with greater compassion. Andy guides a loving kindness meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/699abf77-8d61-4036-8432-dca39d2cecdf.webp"}}}},{"number":6,"title":"How to Deal with Pain","synopsis":"How do we experience pain? Be present without the suffering that feels unbearable, and bring the body and mind together with a body scan meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/f92a3477-d363-4f8c-8d20-cc0ebb3f55fc.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to Deal with Pain","synopsis":"How do we experience pain? Be present without the suffering that feels unbearable, and bring the body and mind together with a body scan meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/f92a3477-d363-4f8c-8d20-cc0ebb3f55fc.webp"}}}},{"number":7,"title":"How to Deal with Anger","synopsis":"Transform your anger into something positive. Andy discusses how a shift in perspective can be a life-changing tool when relating to others.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/28dbbd0f-0fca-4f78-a9ae-d69a7c723e4e.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to Deal with Anger","synopsis":"Transform your anger into something positive. Andy discusses how a shift in perspective can be a life-changing tool when relating to others.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/28dbbd0f-0fca-4f78-a9ae-d69a7c723e4e.webp"}}}},{"number":8,"title":"How to Achieve Your Limitless Potential","synopsis":"Open your mind. Andy explores why the possibilities are limitless with a consistent mindfulness practice and leads a resting awareness meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/c063b3bd-73bc-483a-9a31-d9b314c6ab2d.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:3010":{"title":"How to Achieve Your Limitless Potential","synopsis":"Open your mind. Andy explores why the possibilities are limitless with a consistent mindfulness practice and leads a resting awareness meditation.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/c063b3bd-73bc-483a-9a31-d9b314c6ab2d.webp"}}}}],"images":[]}],"provenance":{},"warnings":[],"externalIdsEvidence":{"wikidata":{"source":"wikidata","sourceUrl":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q104089634","wikidataId":"Q104089634","tmdbId":114419,"type":"tv","imdbId":"tt13617024","tvdbId":393105}},"externalMedia":{"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":114419,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/114419","fetchedAt":"2026-11-07T06:12:37.259Z","originalLanguage":"en-US","title":{"value":"Le guide di Headspace: meditazione","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"Headspace Guide to Meditation","overview":{"value":"Con un approccio amichevole ai benefici della meditazione e l'uso di animazioni, Headspace offre tecniche ed esperienze guidate per avviarsi a questa pratica.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"È tempo di essere gentile con la tua mente.","language":"it-IT"},"startDate":"2021-01-01","endDate":"2021-01-01","status":"Ended","rating":7.8,"ratingCount":83,"numberOfEpisodes":8,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Documentario","Animazione"],"c